  "title": "Augustine of Hippo",
  "summary": "Augustine, born at Thagaste in North Africa in 354, taught rhetoric in Rome and Milan, passed through Manichaean belief and was baptized in Milan. Back in Africa he became bishop of Hippo in 395 and wrote extensively for the church. He died on 28 August 430 as Vandals besieged Hippo.",
